---
// Preview: where the strategy session form sends people who don't qualify yet.
import Growth from '../../layouts/Growth.astro';
import KkHeader from '../../components/KkHeader.astro';
import Arrow from '../../components/growth/Arrow.astro';
---

<Growth
  noHeader
  title="Not a Fit Yet (Preview)"
  description="Demand Flow isn't the right fit right now. Here's what to do instead."
  robots="noindex,nofollow"
>
  <KkHeader />
  <div class="kk-lightpage"><section class="kk-notyet wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Not a fit yet</p>
    <h1>Thanks for being straight with us. Demand Flow isn't the right fit right now.</h1>
    <p class="intro">Based on your answers, the $50,000 guarantee wouldn't be fair to you yet. It needs $3,000 a month in ad spend and an owner who's ready to go. That's not a no forever. Here's what we'd do in your spot.</p>
    <div class="kk-notyet-grid">
      <article>
        <h2>Get the book</h2>
        <p>Marketing is F*cking Easy. The playbook we run inside Dead River, written so you can do it yourself. 92 pages, free.</p>
        <a class="button" href="/downloads/marketing-is-fcking-easy.pdf" download="marketing-is-fcking-easy.pdf">Get the book <Arrow /></a>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Use the data yourself</h2>
        <p>Demand Intelligence gives you the list of people already looking for the services you offer. Call them, email them, or run your own ads to them.</p>
        <a class="button secondary" href="/demand-intelligence">See Demand Intelligence <Arrow /></a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="kk-notyet-foot">Think we got it wrong? Call or text <a href="tel:+19152283054">(915) 228-3054</a> and tell us.</p>
  </section></div>
</Growth>

<style>
  .kk-lightpage { background: #f4f1ea; color: #121214; }
  .kk-lightpage h1, .kk-lightpage h2 { color: #121214; }
  .kk-lightpage .intro, .kk-lightpage p { color: #3a3936; }
  .kk-lightpage .kk-rating, .kk-lightpage .kk-notyet-foot { color: #5f5d57; }
  .kk-lightpage .kk-notyet-grid article { background: #fff; border-color: rgba(0,0,0,.1); }
  .kk-lightpage .button.secondary { color: #121214; border-color: #121214; }
  .kk-lightpage .check-list li { color: #3a3936; }
  .kk-lightpage a { color: var(--copper-deep); }
  .kk-notyet { padding: clamp(56px, 8vw, 100px) 0 80px; max-width: 900px; }
  .kk-notyet h1 { font-size: clamp(34px, 4.6vw, 58px); letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin: 10px 0 16px; }
  .kk-notyet-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 40px; }
  .kk-notyet-grid article { padding: 30px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); border-radius: 20px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #161618, #111112); }
  .kk-notyet-grid h2 { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .kk-notyet-grid p { color: #cfccc4; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .kk-notyet-foot { margin-top: 36px; color: var(--muted); }
  .kk-notyet-foot a { color: var(--ink); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .kk-notyet-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
